E('magellan strait|cape of good hope|bartolomeu dias', 'Bartolomeu Dias was the Portuguese explorer who first sailed around the Cape of Good Hope.', 'He rounded it in 1488.', 'He first named it the Cape of Storms.', 'King John II renamed it the Cape of Good Hope.', 'His voyage proved a sea route around Africa existed.', 'He later died in a storm near the same cape in 1500.')
E('hernan cortes|cortes|cortés', 'Hernán Cortés was the Spanish conquistador who conquered the Aztec Empire.', 'He lived from 1485 to 1547.', 'He landed in Mexico in 1519.', 'He allied with Indigenous enemies of the Aztecs, such as the Tlaxcalans.', 'His interpreter, Malintzin, was vital to his success.', 'Tenochtitlan fell in 1521.')
E('francisco pizarro|pizarro', 'Francisco Pizarro was the Spanish conquistador who conquered the Inca Empire.', 'He lived from about 1478 to 1541.', 'He captured the Inca emperor Atahualpa in 1532.', 'Atahualpa filled a room with gold as ransom but was executed anyway.', 'Pizarro founded Lima in 1535.', 'He was killed by rival Spaniards.')
E('moctezuma|montezuma', 'Moctezuma II was the Aztec emperor when the Spanish arrived.', 'He ruled from 1502 to 1520.', 'He welcomed Cortés into Tenochtitlan.', 'He was taken hostage by the Spanish.', 'He died in 1520 in disputed circumstances.')
E('atahualpa', 'Atahualpa was the last Inca emperor.', 'He lived from about 1502 to 1533.', 'He had just won a civil war against his brother when the Spanish arrived.', 'Pizarro captured him at Cajamarca in 1532.', 'He was executed in 1533.')
E('leif erikson', 'Leif Erikson was a Norse explorer who reached North America.', 'He arrived around the year 1000.', 'He was the son of Erik the Red, who founded settlements in Greenland.', 'He called the land Vinland.', 'A Norse site at L’Anse aux Meadows in Newfoundland confirms the visits.')
E('erik the red', 'Erik the Red was a Norse explorer who founded the first settlements in Greenland.', 'He lived from about 950 to 1003.', 'He was exiled from Iceland for killing several men.', 'He named Greenland to attract settlers.', 'His son Leif reached North America.')
E('henry the navigator', 'Prince Henry the Navigator sponsored Portuguese voyages of exploration.', 'He lived from 1394 to 1460.', 'He funded expeditions down the west coast of Africa.', 'Portuguese ships developed the caravel under his patronage.', 'He rarely sailed himself.')
E('vasco nunez de balboa|balboa', 'Vasco Núñez de Balboa was a Spanish explorer.', 'In 1513 he became the first European to see the Pacific from the Americas.', 'He crossed the Isthmus of Panama.', 'He claimed the ocean for Spain.', 'He was executed by a rival governor in 1519.')
E('john cabot', 'John Cabot was an Italian navigator who sailed for England.', 'He reached North America in 1497.', 'He probably landed in Newfoundland.', 'He was looking for a route to Asia.', 'He disappeared on a later voyage.')
E('dr livingstone|david livingstone|stanley and livingstone', 'David Livingstone was a Scottish missionary and explorer of Africa.', 'He lived from 1813 to 1873.', 'He was the first European to see Victoria Falls, in 1855.', 'He campaigned against the slave trade.', 'The journalist Henry Morton Stanley found him in 1871, supposedly saying, “Dr Livingstone, I presume?”')
E('robert falcon scott|scott of the antarctic', 'Robert Falcon Scott was a British naval officer who led an expedition to the South Pole.', 'He reached the Pole on 17 January 1912.', 'He found that Amundsen had beaten him by five weeks.', 'He and his four companions died on the way back.', 'Lawrence Oates walked out into a blizzard, saying, “I am just going outside and may be some time.”')
E('matthew henson|north pole|robert peary', 'Robert Peary and Matthew Henson led an expedition that claimed to reach the North Pole.', 'They claimed to reach it in April 1909.', 'Henson, an African American explorer, was vital to the expedition.', 'Some historians doubt they reached the exact Pole.', 'The first undisputed surface journey there came much later.')
